	season_03skatepass_currencystorefront_skatepass"*sp__season_03__season_03_premium_passPrice*&sp__entitlement-season_03_premium_pass2ô	Season 03ãThe skate.Pass is a tiered rewards system that enables you to unlock rewards via a currency called ‚ÄúTix‚Äù each season.

There is a mix of items unlockable by all players and premium cosmetics which require you to purchase the skate.Premium Pass in order to redeem.

Tix can be earned via: 
i) Daily, weekly, and seasonal Bounties (including completion bonuses)
ii) New Challenges
iii) Spotlight Challenges
iv) Daily grants (skate.Premium Pass only)
v) Exchange for San Van Bucks
vi) Seasonal Missions

skate.Passes can only be obtained from the store during the season in which they are released.
Any previously purchased Season 4 skate.Premium Pass is now considered a Legacy skate.Pass which allows you to continue unlocking content from it in Season 5. Only the Season 4 skate.Pass will be accessible through Legacy skate.Pass, and will be inaccessible once the current season (Season 5) concludes.

Once the following season (Season 5) ends, you can no longer unlock rewards from the Season 4 Legacy skate.Pass.

Season 5 skate.Premium Pass can only be progressed during Season 5.

Rewards are organized into pages that are unlocked based on the total number of Tix you have earned from any source. You can then redeem your Tix to acquire items on any unlocked page. Spending Tix does not affect your access to pages. Some rewards may require you to claim all other rewards on the page first.

When a Season ends, all Tix in your inventory will be reset to zero. If you have any Tix left in your inventory at this time, they will be automatically redeemed to acquire unclaimed items remaining in the skate.Pass. The automatic redemption will begin with the higher rarity tier items on the last page you‚Äôve unlocked, and work backward through that page and earlier pages until the Tix balance is below the Tix cost of any remaining items. These items will be collected on the first login after the new Season starts.
